      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "In choosing drugs for treatment of ischemic heart disease or hypertension one has--next to effects on angina or blood pressure--to consider possible influences on long term course. A simple dosing-scheme with a low number of tablets as well as a thorough information of the patient about the prescribed medication are equally important for the therapeutic success."},
